sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant R as runner
    participant P as shared page
    participant D as harden_local
    participant K as KCOV buffer
    participant L as /dev/kmsg
    participant C as controller
    R->>R: domain hands over std::vector of Cmd, already well-formed
    R->>P: ToPage: u16 count, then 8-byte commands
    R->>L: drain, so only this input's records count
    R->>K: cover[0] = 0
    R->>D: ioctl(HARDEN_RUN)
    D->>K: each basic block records its PC
    alt SET_RAW, flag 0xA5, idx at least 16
        D->>L: BUG: KASAN slab-out-of-bounds, kernel keeps running
    end
    K-->>R: cover[1..n]
    R->>R: PCs and PC pairs into the extra-features section, user domains 0 and 1
    R->>L: read new records
    alt a KASAN record appeared
        R->>R: EXPECT_FALSE fails, the property fails
        R-->>C: failure, input index
        C->>R: re-run alone, kasan_multi_shot reports again
        C->>C: save crashes.000000/sha1 on the host
    else clean
        R-->>C: features for this input
    end
